!missing-selector! +AVCaptionRenderer::captionPreviewForProfileID:extendedLanguageTag:renderSize: not bound
!missing-type! AVCaptionRenderer not bound

# AVAudioSessionInterruptionReasonKey is API_UNAVAILABLE(tvos); the header's contradictory
# API_DEPRECATED(tvos(14.5, 27.0)) makes upstream libclang believe it exists on tvOS.
!missing-field! AVAudioSessionInterruptionReasonKey not bound

